So, \$3a_1 + 3a_2 + 2a_4 = 0\$, or equivalently \$a_4 = -\frac{3(a_1 + a_2)}{2}\$.
Substituting these equations into the original polynomial \$p\$, we find that at \$\left(\frac{a}{c}, \frac{b}{c}\right)\$,
